Short:        Zlib link library for StormC 4
Author:       Jean-loup Gaily, Mark Adler et al., Jan-Erik Karlsson
Uploader:     Jan-Erik Karlsson
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.2.1
Replaces:     zlib_S4.lha
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Required:     StormC 4

this is a simple port of the zlib library for stormC 4
it's an update of the link library that comes with stormC4
all versions is here (000, 020 603 and 881)

the 020 version is compiled with the 68020-60 option

(if you want a 040|060 version contact me)

